<p>Year-to-date$89.5	$84.8	  +5.6	+6.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is  five  weeks ended April 5.</p>
<p>Full company name is The Bon-Ton Stores Inc.</p>
